#. type: Title =
#: pages/contact.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
#| msgid "Contacting the Fedora Council"
msgid "Contacting the {team_name}"
msgstr "Kontakta {team_name}"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/contact.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The {team_name} uses three platforms for communications, one for "
"asynchronous, one for asynchronous, and one for decision-making.  Anyone "
"registered with an account in the https://accounts.fedoraproject.org[Fedora "
"Account System] (FAS) can log in with their account to participate in either"
" platform."
msgstr ""
"{team_name} använder tre plattformar för kommunikation: en för asynkron "
"kommunikation, en för asynkron kommunikation och en för beslutsfattande.  "
"Alla som har ett konto i https://accounts.fedoraproject.org[Fedora Account "
"System] (FAS) kan logga in med sitt konto för att delta på valfri plattform."

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/contact.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fedora Discussion (asynchronous)"
msgstr "Fedora Discussion (asynkront)"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/contact.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The link:{team_asynch_communication}[*#council tag*] on "
"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/[Fedora Discussion] is the primary "
"space for {team_name} conversations.  We use this for discussion within the "
"{team_name} as a team, and it is also the best place for any community "
"member to engage in or start a conversation with us."
msgstr ""
"Taggen link:{team_asynch_communication}[*#council*] på "
"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/[Fedora Discussion] är den främsta "
"platsen för samtal med {team_name}.  Vi använder den för diskussioner inom "
"{team_name} som grupp, och den är också den bästa platsen för alla i "
"gemenskapen som vill delta i eller inleda ett samtal med oss."

#. type: Title ===
#: pages/contact.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Private mailing list"
msgstr "Privat sändlista"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/contact.adoc:22
#| msgid ""
#| "https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/council-"
#| "private@lists.fedoraproject.org/[*council-private*] is a private list. Its "
#| "membership is restricted to the current Council members, and it is not "
#| "archived.  This list is only used for topics that cannot be discussed on the"
#| " public forum."
msgid ""
"We also have a private mailing list: "
"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/council-"
"private@lists.fedoraproject.org/[*council-private*].  Its membership is "
"restricted to the current {team_name} members and discussions there are not "
"archived.  This list is only used for topics that cannot be discussed on the"
" public forum.  We use it as little as possible."
msgstr ""
"Vi har också en privat sändlista: "
"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/council-"
"private@lists.fedoraproject.org/[*council-private*].  Medlemskapet är "
"begränsat till de nuvarande medlemmarna i {team_name}, och diskussionerna "
"där arkiveras inte.  Listan används endast för ämnen som inte kan diskuteras"
" i det offentliga forumet.  Vi använder den så lite som möjligt."

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/contact.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fedora Chat (synchronous)"
msgstr "Fedora Chat (synkront)"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/contact.adoc:28
#| msgid ""
#| "Council members are also often present on the "
#| "https://matrix.to/#/#council:fedoraproject.org[*#council*] channel on "
#| "chat.fedoraproject.org (briged to the *#fedora-council* IRC channel on "
#| "https://libera.chat/[Libera.Chat])."
msgid ""
"{team_name} members are also often present on the "
"link:{team_synch_communication}[*#council:fedoraproject.org* Matrix room] on"
" https://chat.fedoraproject.org[chat.fedoraproject.org]."
msgstr ""
"Medlemmar i {team_name} finns också ofta i "
"link:{team_synch_communication}[*#council:fedoraproject.org*-rummet på "
"Matrix] på https://chat.fedoraproject.org[chat.fedoraproject.org]."

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/contact.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pagure (decision-making)"
msgstr "Pagure (beslutsfattande)"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/contact.adoc:34
msgid ""
"It is better to start with an asynchronous conversation, described above."
msgstr "Det är bättre att börja med ett asynkront samtal, som beskrivs ovan."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/contact.adoc:39
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have an issue to be worked on by the Council you can also open a "
#| "ticket on the https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/tickets[Council Pagure "
#| "instance]. This is a public issue tracker. However, if you have a "
#| "particularly privacy- or security-sensitive issue, you can check the "
#| "*Private* box when you create the ticket. If an issue is not sensitive the "
#| "discussion should be in the open, in the public Pagure instance or "
#| "Discussion."
msgid ""
"When you have a specific proposal for the {team_name} to make a decision, "
"open a ticket on the link:{team_issue_tracker}[*{team_name} Pagure "
"instance*].  This is a public issue tracker.  However, if you have a "
"privacy- or security-sensitive issue, check the *Private* box when you "
"create the ticket.  If an issue is not sensitive, the discussion should open"
" and public."
msgstr ""
"När du har ett konkret förslag som {team_name} ska fatta beslut om, öppnar "
"du ett ärende i link:{team_issue_tracker}[*{team_name}s Pagure-instans*].  "
"Det är en offentlig ärendehanterare.  Om du har ett integritets- eller "
"säkerhetskänsligt ärende markerar du dock rutan *Private* när du skapar "
"ärendet.  Om ett ärende inte är känsligt ska diskussionen vara öppen och "
"offentlig."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/contact.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Note that ticket comments should be kept to a minimum.  Discussion should be"
" at link:{team_asynch_communication}[#council] and the ticket used to record"
" procedural actions like votes and approved resolutions."
msgstr ""
"Observera att kommentarerna i ärenden bör hållas till ett minimum.  "
"Diskussionen ska föras på link:{team_asynch_communication}[#council], medan "
"ärendet används för att dokumentera administrativa åtgärder som omröstningar"
" och godkända beslut."

#~ msgid "The Fedora Council uses two mailing lists."
#~ msgstr "Fedorarådet använder två sändlistor."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/c/project/council-discuss/60[*Council "
#~ "Discussion*] is a public category on Fedora Discussion.  This is the main "
#~ "discussion point for the Fedora Council, and the goal of the is to either "
#~ "reach a decision, or to delegate the thread to a more appropriate location."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/c/project/council-discuss/60[*Council "
#~ "Discussion*] är en publik kategori på Fedora Discussion. Detta är den "
#~ "huvudsakliga diskussionspunkten för Fedorarådet, och målet är att antingen "
#~ "nå ett beslut, eller att delegera tråden till en mer passande plats."
